          ``X`` and ``k >= 1``;
        - the finite subsets of ``X`` number ``2^|X|`` for finite ``X``
          and ``|X|`` for infinite ``X``;
        - ``|prod_i X_i| = prod_i |X_i|`` and ``|coprod_i X_i| =
